# Experiment 1 (generation seeds): every task and format, judged, low reasoning effort.
# One line per run: <out dir> <model> [agbench eval run args]; run with: scripts/run_plan.sh experiments/seeds.plan
# Original runs: UC Davis farm cluster, one RTX 6000 Ada per run, agbench commit 9352706, judge prompt v3.
# The verdicts in the paper were then re-judged with the v4 judge prompt (commit 524ee35, now the default in
# src/agbench/eval/prompts.yaml) into runs/rejudge_v4/exp/seeds; running this plan with the current code judges with v4 directly.
runs/exp/seeds/s0 mistralai/Ministral-3-14B-Instruct-2512 --judge --gen-seed 0
